# Changelog

To install the unreleased pytest-pgsnap version, see [developmental releases](https://pytest-pgsnap.git-pull.com/quickstart.html#developmental-releases).

[pip](https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/):

```console
$ pip install --user --upgrade --pre pytest-pgsnap
```

## pytest-pgsnap 0.0.0 (unreleased)

