### Breaking changes

#### The bundled doctest collector is gone (#10)

pytest-pgsnap shipped a stale copy of gp-libs' `doctest-docutils` plugin.
Both registered the same options, so the two could never load together — the
duplicate plugin name hid that by letting only one win. Depend on
[gp-libs](https://gp-libs.git-pull.com) for doctest collection; this package
no longer registers a pytest plugin at all.

